From 991543b27927ce8080393b46ee604d5fd0e5a815 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Masoud <masouddehghani@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 22:24:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] xgameruntime: Implement XGameSave on local storage.

Add the XGameSave composite ({704c3f58-e629-4cc2-b197-30511b996fe2}).
Titles reach it through xgameruntime.lib thunks that call slot
3 + n for the n-th function of XGameSave.h.  Containers are kept as
directories and blobs as files under
%LOCALAPPDATA%\WineGDK\XGameSave\<SCID>, updates are staged and
renamed into place, and asynchronous calls run on the native GDK
threading sidecar so the title's XAsyncGetStatus/XAsyncGetResultSize
find native state.  Also define the E_GS_* error codes.

Minecraft Legends waits on "Loading, please wait" forever without it.
---
 .../GDKComponent/System/XGameSave.c           | 1177 +++++++++++++++++
 dlls/xgameruntime/Makefile.in                 |    1 +
 dlls/xgameruntime/main.c                      |    8 +
 include/xgameerr.h                            |   15 +
 4 files changed, 1201 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 dlls/xgameruntime/GDKComponent/System/XGameSave.c

